# The ANO-RCC shorthand contractions (ANO-RCC-MB, -VDZ, -VDZP, -VTZ, -VTZP, -VQZP): an alias and the contraction it
# names, per element. From OpenMolcas's basis_library/basis.tbl (https://gitlab.com/Molcas/OpenMolcas), its ANO-rcc
# lines unchanged; LGPL 2.1, as ANO-RCC itself.
